              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni nee Mose an kudaá kilá' nee waawutmo Farao oo Misri taa axwees, as múk Israeli nguwa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa duuxiya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
